"hesitations and repeats; a French translation of it; or what you say fitted "
"to the field you type in. Anything but the first is shown on screen while "
"you speak and typed a sentence at a time."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:67
msgid "Chinese writing"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:68
msgid ""
"Speech models write Chinese in whichever script they like. Choose simplified "
"or traditional characters, with the words used in Taiwan or the characters "
"used in Hong Kong, and what you say is typed that way. Other languages are "
"left as they are."
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:78
msgid "Keep a record of what was changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:79
msgid ""
